  "description": "The heartwarming tale of a winter wonderland.\n\nThis little snow sprite is looking for fun, friends, and a place where it belongs — and not even a grumpy old man can stop it! As winter deepens and the snow sprite burrows itself into his life, the old man discovers a joyous warmth that he could have never expected.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
